{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜公僕照顧家庭假(二)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-12-12-48-392JiwgZ72.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：公僕照顧家庭假</p><p>政府計劃明年1月起實施政府僱員照顧家庭假，每名僱員每年最多有12小時，可以短暫離開工作崗位照顧家庭需要，工會有何意見？私人市場又會否跟隨？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>公務員工會聯合會總幹事梁籌庭</p><p>人力資源管理學會政策倡議及研究委員會聯席主席殷暉</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T05:28:27.711419+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T04:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T05:21:59.814140+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T05:21:59.814140+00:00","content_hash":"a6a464fe7102809850459f3c4dd900b2d405a52b02115656a6e2d1a1b473eddf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}